        "subject": "LU-21238 tests: restore client mount after sanity-sec 300",
        "message": "LU-21238 tests: restore client mount after sanity-sec 300\n\nsanity-sec test_300 unmounts $MOUNT on the first client and does\nnot mount it again. A later suite in the same session, such as\nsanity-pcc, uses that client as a copytool agent and fails with\n\"Failed to start copytool\" because no Lustre is mounted at\n$MOUNT there.\n\nRemount $MOUNT on the client when the test exits, on every path.\n\nFixes: cbb05e65e7 (\"LU-19921 llite: Add user_principal for client mount option\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-sec\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I69f06950cdd7d5e8858ec76f5b0bfe84cb320941\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
